WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
<b>Oobi</b>

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:05.110
<i>Field change for Oobi Middle.</i>

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:09.650
<i>Idemitsu-kun is taking over
from pitcher Seko-kun.</i>

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:15.280
<i>Seko-kun moves to shortstop.
Mayumura-san moves to second.</i>

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:20.430
What? A pitcher change after three
innings when he was on for a no-hitter?

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:25.290
Jus' like against Eihou, they're splittin' the
pitchin' duties by doin' three innings each.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.280
<i>Splitting the pitching, huh?</i>

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:34.500
<i>If every three innings, they switch
to a pitcher we haven't seen before,</i>

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.380
<i>it gives us zero time to
get used to their pitching.</i>

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:46.020
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:46.020
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:46.020
<b>Oobi</b>

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:44.400
<i>Four innings left. I really want to
claw some of that back at least,</i>

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.020
<i>but it's gonna be tough.</i>

00:02:16.590 --> 00:02:20.070
<i>Batting first, center field, Fujii-san.</i>

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:25.040
Yeah! Chisato! Make 'em suffer!

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:30.710
<b>Reconnected Feelings</b>

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.070
Strike!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.860
Strike two!

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:49.060
Strike! You're out!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:52.990
No, these things happen!

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:55.050
Just focus on the next one! The next one!

00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:57.530
We get it, so maybe just sit
back down and watch, yeah?

00:02:58.010 --> 00:03:01.540
What <i>was</i> that? There's no way
I can hit a slider like that.

00:03:01.540 --> 00:03:05.990
Chisato, go to the bullpen
and start warming up with Anita.

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:07.030
Huh?

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.370
Nishina's reached his limit, so we'll switch
you in for the bottom of the inning.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.380
Oh, uh, sure!

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:17.300
Yer gettin' switched out. Ya okay with that?

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:18.920
Shut up.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:21.430
I gave up five runs. What else was he gonna do?

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.380
Out!

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:33.410
Oh, wow.

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.130
Strike! Out!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.930
Three outs. Change sides.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.780
<i>Th-They're strong.</i>

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.580
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.580
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.580
<b>Oobi</b>

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.580
<i>I don't see any way we can win...</i>

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.440
Daigo! Change sides.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:54.040
Oh, uh, right.

00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:00.110
<i>Field change for Fuurin Academy.</i>

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:06.470
<i>Center fielder Fujii-san is taking
over from pitcher Nishina-kun.</i>

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:10.430
<i>Nishina-kun moves to center field.</i>

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.890
They switched him out.

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:16.360
I think she used to be a relief
pitcher for Yokohama Little, too.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:20.720
I didn't really want to throw you in
when you've barely had any prep time,

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:21.920
but we've got no choice.

00:04:21.920 --> 00:04:26.320
Anyway, just throw strikes and try to
get us through the remaining innings.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:29.690
Yes, sir! I'll do my best!

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:35.130
<i>Batting seventh, right field, Miura-kun.</i>

00:04:35.130 --> 00:04:36.040
Play!

00:04:38.080 --> 00:04:41.180
<i>Seems like she's got zero nerves.
I wonder if she'll be okay...</i>

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:52.440
Three outs. Change sides.

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:58.440
Heck, yeah! That's my daughter!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.400
Amazing...

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.470
That was seriously great, Chisato!

00:05:05.470 --> 00:05:09.670
I already liked what I saw in practice, 
but I didn't know you were <i>that</i> good!

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:12.700
Oh, it was nothing, really.
It was the bottom of their order.

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:17.670
Besides, my stamina's not great either,
so don't expect too much from me.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.630
<i>Did she just say "either"?</i>

00:05:20.900 --> 00:05:23.850
Anyway, it's time we got a run on the board.

00:05:23.850 --> 00:05:26.070
We haven't even registered a hit yet.

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:27.570
Uh, right.

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:31.330
Don't get cocky just 'cause
you made it through one inning!

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:35.900
Being a starting pitcher is
a <i>lot</i> harder in <i>so</i> many ways!

00:05:35.900 --> 00:05:37.040
Excuse me?

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.560
<i>Top of the fifth, Fuurin Academy to bat.</i>

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:45.320
<i>Batting fourth, catcher, Shigeno-kun.</i>

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:50.240
<i>She's right. We still haven't gotten a hit.</i>

00:05:54.830 --> 00:05:56.000
Strike!

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.590
Strike two!

00:06:04.450 --> 00:06:08.970
<i>There's no way I can hit a slider
this sharp on my first look at it.</i>

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.580
<i>There's no way...</i>

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:20.170
<i>But if the captain gives up, it's all over!</i>

00:06:24.680 --> 00:06:25.740
Foul!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.460
<i>I won't let you get a perfect 
game with relief pitchers!</i>

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.380
Ball!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:39.650
Nice, Senpai! A full count!

00:06:39.650 --> 00:06:41.790
Hang in there!

00:06:43.030 --> 00:06:44.590
So annoying.

00:06:48.970 --> 00:06:50.130
Foul!

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.780
It's still a perfect game, Idemitsu!

00:06:52.780 --> 00:06:54.290
Don't walk him!

00:06:56.280 --> 00:07:00.060
<i>It looks like he hasn't inherited
his father's talent for baseball,</i>

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:05.620
<i>but Shigeno-kun's always had
the same air about him.</i>

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:13.910
Ball! Ball four!

00:07:14.110 --> 00:07:15.810
Yeah, good eye!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.370
We got a runner!

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:20.070
<i>Damn.</i>

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.670
<i>Batting fifth, center field, Nishina-kun.</i>

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.320
Let's do this!

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.990
Yer lookin' up for this.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:31.630
'Course I am! I'm gonna go big and
bag us two runs to get us rolling!

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:36.370
Whew, thank goodness. They won't
get a perfect game now.

00:07:36.370 --> 00:07:38.100
That woulda been embarrassing.

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:42.760
It's not over yet. We'll get a hit next,
then avoid the shutout.

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:45.560
After that, there may be 
even more to come, you know?

00:07:47.750 --> 00:07:48.530
Play!

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:54.130
We don't have another pitcher ready!

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:57.460
Besides, the game isn't over yet, and
there's too many innings left to just give up!

00:07:57.460 --> 00:08:00.830
A starting pitcher doesn't throw in the
towel just because they got a bloody nose!

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:03.420
<i>Damn it all.</i>

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:06.380
<i>They got those five runs off me.</i>

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:09.590
<i>I have to get them back with my bat!</i>

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:17.730
<i>Damn! His fastball's plenty quick,
and he's got sliders in the mix as well?</i>

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.350
You can do it! Relax!

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.670
<i>Anita's next up, huh?</i>

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.700
<i>What I need to do above all else right now...</i>

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:29.190
<i>...is advance the runner!</i>

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:37.050
First!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:39.660
Out!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.080
Nice bunt!

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:46.370
Why? We coulda got him out at second.

00:08:46.370 --> 00:08:49.410
We're five runs up.
We don't have to take risks.

00:08:49.410 --> 00:08:53.550
If we mess up and allow more runners on base,
we'll be playing right into their hands.

00:08:53.750 --> 00:08:57.660
<i>Batting sixth, left field, Kabashima-san.</i>

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:02.470
<i>Nishina was all set to slug it, 
but he went for a bunt instead?</i>

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:06.310
Strike!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:09.770
<i>We can't jus' roll over
and let it end like this!</i>

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:13.440
<i>One run.</i>

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:18.160
<i>I hafta get Shigeno-senpai
home, no matter what!</i>

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:21.660
Second!

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:26.080
It didn't go through!

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:31.170
<i>No, but from that angle,
a leftie can't throw it to first in time—</i>

00:09:33.530 --> 00:09:34.420
Out!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:40.360
So close. I thought that
was gonna be our first hit.

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:44.350
You gotta be kiddin' me! No way
was that a middle school play!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.360
Nice, Michiru!

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:49.880
Phew, I thought our no-no was toast.

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:54.320
<i>Batting seventh, first base, Tanba-kun.</i>

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:57.140
And Tanba-san's up now...

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.280
Looks like Nishina's bunt was for nothing.

00:10:03.030 --> 00:10:05.310
Tanba-san, pick one to swing at!

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.620
It'll be fine! You can do this!

00:10:07.620 --> 00:10:09.180
Just relax!

00:10:12.390 --> 00:10:16.410
<i>Oh, yeah, Kandori the
southpaw killer is up after him.</i>

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:18.340
<i>If Tanba can keep us rolling...</i>

00:10:21.650 --> 00:10:23.340
He kept us rollin'!

00:10:23.340 --> 00:10:25.310
Not that he did anything, but still!

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.210
Timeout!

00:10:29.590 --> 00:10:31.560
Yo, man, what's wrong?

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:37.200
Well, I tried catching that ball earlier
with my left hand and it hit my finger.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.410
So is your finger okay?

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:44.040
It's nothing to worry about.
It's just a bit numb, that's all.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.670
I'll take out their 8-hole and that'll be that.

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:51.580
<i>Batting eighth, third base, Kandori-san.</i>

00:10:55.980 --> 00:10:58.010
<i>Two outs, runners on first and third.</i>

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.850
<i>Top of the fifth, 0-5 down.</i>

00:11:00.850 --> 00:11:03.930
<i>We still haven't gotten a hit,
but this is our first real chance.</i>

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:08.890
<i>With Kandori the southpaw killer
at bat, something might happen.</i>

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:12.910
Ball!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:19.100
<i>That Idemitsu... Is he still feeling
the effects of the ball hitting his hand?</i>

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.530
<i>Considering the strikeout earlier,</i>

00:11:22.530 --> 00:11:26.840
<i>I doubt their 8-hole can get
anything on Idemitsu's fastball.</i>

00:11:27.840 --> 00:11:31.620
<i>But we should play it safe 
and go for a slider, anyway.</i>

00:11:35.140 --> 00:11:35.930
Ball!

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.380
Yeah, all right!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.070
Nice, nice, nice!

00:11:39.070 --> 00:11:41.260
The pitcher's lost it!

00:11:41.540 --> 00:11:44.800
What are you doing, Idemitsu? 
Get it in the strike zone already!

00:11:45.880 --> 00:11:47.360
<i>Can it.</i>

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:50.230
<i>I haven't got the feeling
back in my fingertips yet.</i>

00:11:50.950 --> 00:11:53.370
<i>He's having trouble with breaking balls.</i>

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:57.190
<i>We've got no choice.
We can't walk their 8-hole here.</i>

00:11:57.980 --> 00:11:59.150
<i>Fastball!</i>

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:04.570
Strike!

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:07.030
That's one you have to hit.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:10.860
Strike two!

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.240
Come on.

00:12:12.240 --> 00:12:13.790
You gotta swing, Senpai!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.170
She can't see those pitches.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:18.990
<i>Even if she's good against southpaws,</i>

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:21.640
<i>I guess a pitcher at that level
is just too fast for her.</i>

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:22.970
Finish her!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:28.230
Second!

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.270
She dropped it!

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:40.230
Kandori, run!

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.450
It's behind you, Michiru!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:54.500
And I'm dead.

00:13:01.930 --> 00:13:03.050
Safe!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:05.440
Yeah!

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:06.970
Nice, Kan-chan!

00:13:07.330 --> 00:13:09.350
That's our southpaw killer for you.

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:12.130
Hey, are you okay, Kandori?

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.360
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:16.610
You did great.

00:13:16.610 --> 00:13:20.320
You let two strikes go by, so I was 
convinced you couldn't swing.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:26.780
Well, he was pitching more balls,
so I figured he was struggling.

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:29.830
And at five runs down,
a base on balls is better, right?

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.040
Nice.

00:13:35.050 --> 00:13:39.210
Damn! The no-no and shutout relay bit the dust.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:43.460
I never expected her to get so much on that.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:48.950
It's no good. If you still can't throw 
sliders, we'll switch Michiru in.

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:53.640
What? Is this some bad joke?!
I haven't even pitched two full innings!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.600
That makes it look like
they got the better of me!

00:13:57.130 --> 00:14:00.100
Stop getting so hung up on your stupid pride!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:03.360
If you can't hit top form because
you're shaking off an injury,

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.320
we don't know what might happen.

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:09.780
If their 9-hole up next gets on base,
they're back to the top of their order.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:14.490
If they manage to claw back all those runs,
will <i>you</i> take responsibility for that?

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:18.960
Didn't we decide to take the
middle school rubber-ball crown?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:24.060
We don't have time to stumble even
once against this kind of opponent.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:30.650
Oh well. I don't want to put Michiru 
on the mound without warming up first.

00:14:31.670 --> 00:14:33.850
Shut this 9-hole down.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.830
If you don't, we're switching to Michiru.

00:14:37.850 --> 00:14:41.740
<i>Batting ninth, right field, Sakura-san.</i>

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:45.500
Keep us rollin', Senpai!

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:46.690
<i>Like hell you will!</i>

00:14:47.740 --> 00:14:48.950
Ball!

00:14:49.260 --> 00:14:50.910
Nice, nice, nice!

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:54.420
<i>She's been giving it her all
out in right field this game.</i>

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:58.080
<i>After pitching three games back-to-back,
including the whole of today's early game,</i>

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:01.680
<i>Mutsuko must be totally drained,
physically and emotionally.</i>

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:12.820
Are you okay?

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.970
Oh gosh, that was embarrassing.

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.230
Foul!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:29.950
<i>I touched it!</i>

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:33.760
Foul!

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:38.060
<i>This is annoying.
She's waiting for his fastballs.</i>

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.080
<i>In that case, let's go for a slider.</i>

00:15:43.770 --> 00:15:45.360
<i>We only have one ball so far.</i>

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.210
<i>If this is a ball too, it won't matter,</i>

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.310
<i>and if it's a strike, she won't get near it.</i>

00:15:49.310 --> 00:15:53.010
<i>Since she's got her back to the wall,
she'll swing at it, anyway!</i>

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:59.010
<i>Aw man, he threw a slider!</i>

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:01.810
Crap!

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:03.940
An uncaught third strike! Run!

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:05.310
Seriously?!

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.550
<i>O-Oh no!</i>

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.560
<i>My leg's cramping!</i>

00:16:34.210 --> 00:16:35.960
Safe! Safe!

00:16:36.520 --> 00:16:37.980
Heck yeah!

00:16:37.980 --> 00:16:39.890
Can't stop this train, and it's bases loaded!

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:44.150
I-I'm so relieved...

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:50.830
Senpai! You need ta get on deck.
I'll take over as base coach!

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:51.970
Right.

00:16:56.220 --> 00:17:00.000
I'm getting swapped out for that? Really?

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.900
Uozumi, you should've had that one.

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:05.870
All right, all right. You get one more chance.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.070
You have to stop them scoring!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.800
<i>Batting first, pitcher, Fujii-san.</i>

00:17:15.140 --> 00:17:16.220
<i>Mutsuko...</i>

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.180
<i>Dammit!</i>

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:20.640
<i>Don't get so cocky, losers!</i>

00:17:24.210 --> 00:17:25.190
Wha—

00:17:25.760 --> 00:17:28.610
All right! We got another run back!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:29.900
No, no, no, no!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:33.820
It's 2-5! Three runs in it!

00:17:33.980 --> 00:17:35.780
Yay!

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.980
She's got good sense.
I wonder who she takes after.

00:17:38.980 --> 00:17:41.240
What's <i>that</i> supposed to mean?

00:17:41.430 --> 00:17:46.430
Well, you won't stop an ex-Yokohama
Little player with fastballs.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.190
Michiru!

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:53.210
<i>Field change for Oobi Middle.</i>

00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:58.260
<i>Mayumura-san is taking over
from pitcher Idemitsu-kun.</i>

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:07.040
<i>I never dreamed we'd have to put
you up on the mound in the fifth.</i>

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:12.200
I know your arm isn't warmed
up yet. You going to be okay?

00:18:12.200 --> 00:18:15.110
I didn't think you'd feel
 the need to ask me that.

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:18.070
As if these guys could hit my pitches.

00:18:18.520 --> 00:18:22.030
These guys chickened out of
joining Senior League. I didn't.

00:18:23.750 --> 00:18:25.960
<i>So Michiru-chan's their trump card, huh?</i>

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:28.400
Tao.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:30.770
Do you know what pitches Mayumura has?

00:18:30.770 --> 00:18:34.440
From the game earlier, it looked
like she had sliders, curveballs,

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:37.170
and something like a changeup.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:41.340
Yeah, yeah, I know. I was watching, too.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:44.590
Her fastballs are fast as hell
and she's got variety.

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:47.460
It'll be impossible to do 
anything first time up.

00:18:48.760 --> 00:18:52.040
<i>The momentum's with us this inning.</i>

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.900
<i>Please don't let it ebb away, Tao.</i>

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:57.590
<i>Batting second, shortstop, Sagara-san.</i>

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.360
Play!

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:03.750
Ball!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.330
Okay! Yer seein' 'em!

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.170
Strike!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:35.440
<b>Girl's Bathroom</b>

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:34.680
Oh, yeah, did you hear, Tao?

00:19:34.680 --> 00:19:35.440
Hear what?

00:19:35.820 --> 00:19:40.400
Mayumura Michiru apparently 
gave Senior League a go, too.

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:42.400
What? Seriously?

00:19:42.400 --> 00:19:44.340
Yup, intel from Nishina.

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:46.780
Wow, that's impressive.

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:49.580
Sure, even boys have to be
good to make it in, but for a girl,

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:52.830
it's impossible without crazy
determination and a body to back it up.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:55.400
Strike two!

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.900
It's a pain in the butt.

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:02.610
Both Daigo and Anita get super serious
when we take on these try-hards.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:08.910
A real pain in the butt.
They all get their uniforms so dirty...

00:20:09.370 --> 00:20:11.170
And ours are all white...

00:20:13.350 --> 00:20:14.650
You know, Tao...

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:19.530
We might not be able to do
anything against the boys,

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:27.410
but don't you just get irritated
when another girl beats you?

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.500
<i>Uh-oh.</i>

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:32.460
<i>Oh no, a grounder to shortstop.</i>

00:20:51.090 --> 00:20:53.260
We're all muddy again.

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:55.070
Just like every day.

00:20:55.070 --> 00:20:58.400
Wow, our new uniforms are so cute!

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:00.160
It looks so good on you!

00:21:00.160 --> 00:21:02.530
You too! You look super cute.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:03.800
Thank you!

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.280
Good work.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.520
I got so dirty again today.

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.250
Huh? Tao, you're super clean!

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.460
If you're really good, you don't get dirty.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:27.050
Run hard! Sagara-senpai!

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:31.820
Out!

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.690
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.690
<b>Fuurin Academy</b>

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:35.690
<b>Oobi</b>

00:21:33.330 --> 00:21:35.210
Three outs! Change sides!

00:21:44.580 --> 00:21:45.780
Senpai...

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:54.430
Don't jump to any conclusions, okay?

00:21:55.160 --> 00:21:59.390
It's not like I've been
taking it easy up till now.

00:21:59.860 --> 00:22:06.020
Headfirst slides don't make you any faster,
you can get hurt, and there's no real upside.

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:13.600
I just wanted to get my uniform 
as dirty as everyone else's.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:24.800
Okay, we got two runs back!

00:22:24.800 --> 00:22:26.370
The momentum's with us!

00:22:27.400 --> 00:22:29.190
The real fight starts here!

00:24:00.470 --> 00:24:02.080
All right! Just three runs behind!

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:03.830
Stand your ground, Chisato!

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:05.420
Your dad's here for you!

00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:08.250
Hey, Fujii-kun, you're way too loud.

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:11.800
But Chisato has no experience 
as a long reliever!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:14.560
Ah, if only there was another pitcher!

00:24:14.560 --> 00:24:16.680
Chisato-chan's trying her best on the mound!

00:24:16.680 --> 00:24:18.310
We have to get a run somehow!

00:24:18.310 --> 00:24:20.020
Make something happen, Daigo!

00:24:20.020 --> 00:24:24.980
<b>The Unexpected Pitcher</b>

00:24:20.360 --> 00:24:22.490
Next time: "The Unexpected Pitcher"!

00:24:22.490 --> 00:24:24.510
Run to the stage of your dreams!
